# Copy this file to `.env` and paste your key in.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# ⚠️ `.env` is in .gitignore. The key must never be committed, and it must never
# reach the browser — every call to Anthropic is made by apps/api, server-side.
#
# Without this key the site works exactly as it always has: the readiness report
# and the roadmap are deterministic and free. Only the "in plain words" panel
# changes, and it falls back to a summary assembled from the rules themselves.
#
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com  →  API keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
